{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3019, "text": "Mail call."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 7380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4740, "text": "More people asking for money from the\nFuel Foundation."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 9840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8180, "text": "Gee, Dan, can I open some of those?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 12880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10240, "text": "The only mail I get is from people\nstudying abnormal psychology."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 16840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14300, "text": "How come there are so many problems in\nthe world?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 20680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17360, "text": "Did you realize those people on the\nstreet covered in blankets are actually"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 21680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20680, "text": "homeless?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 23860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22140, "text": "Of course, Dan. What did you think?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 25100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 24080, "text": "I thought they were Indians."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 28820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27360, "text": "Not very sensitive, Dan."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 30080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29080, "text": "It was an honest mistake."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 33350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30590, "text": "Sounds like the Phil Foundation is\nopening your eyes to reality."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 37230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33890, "text": "Oh, you bet it is. Never realized there\nwere so many losers out there before."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 41750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39070, "text": "What are you doing?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 45650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42110, "text": "Oh, just putting a little distance\nbetween myself and the impending"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 46650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45650, "text": "bolt."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 48630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47430, "text": "Go read your book."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 52730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51730, "text": "Hey, Jack."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 54870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53130, "text": "I'm taking the news. Here's a box."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 57890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55270, "text": "Uh, son, complete the transaction."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 59510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58510, "text": "Sure, Pop."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 66760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64420, "text": "Thank you for your patronage. Have a\nnice day."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 74860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71600, "text": "I'm afraid you made a small mistake.\nThis is only a quarter. You owe me 50"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 75860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74860, "text": "cents. Son."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 79300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76060, "text": "Pop, I only did what you told me to do.\nNo, I told you the only one we"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 80620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79300, "text": "shortchange is Fielding."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 83960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82700, "text": "This is Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 86900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84320, "text": "Judge Stone, my son, Marty."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 89120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87620, "text": "Nice to meet you, Marty. Likewise."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 93960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92020, "text": "I'm bringing Marty into the family\nbusiness."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 95360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94260, "text": "He's got a real knack for it."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 99460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98240, "text": "Isn't he something?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 101400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100120, "text": "Yeah, he's something."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 102620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101620, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 104760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103760, "text": "Hey, guys."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 105820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104820, "text": "Hi, Eric."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 109760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105840, "text": "Harry, did you have any idea that\nthey're cutting down the rainforest so"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 112200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109760, "text": "they're destroying the world's\necological balance?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 114080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113080, "text": "Yeah, I knew that."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 115680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114440, "text": "Everyone knows that, right?"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 116920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115920, "text": "Yeah, of course."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 119120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117540, "text": "What did somebody tell me?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 124340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121000, "text": "Because the only balance you're ever\ninterested in is trying to stay on your"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 125340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 124340, "text": "waterbed."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 128180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126620, "text": "This is all so depressing."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 132220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128860, "text": "Well, maybe this will cheer you up. You\ngot a phone call from someone named"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 137120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 132220, "text": "Monique. Oh, jeez, I forgot. She's\nflying in from Paris tomorrow."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 142880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138100, "text": "Great. That gives me 24 hours to shelter\nthe homeless, feed the poor, fill my"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 144100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142880, "text": "bathtub with Jell -O."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 148880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146180, "text": "You think this Monique is part of Dan's\ncharity stuff?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 152730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 149470, "text": "Not unless she's a representative of the\nAmerican Tart Association."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 156390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154230, "text": "There you go again, Roz, radiating\nnegativity."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 159610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 156910, "text": "I think it's time for some self\n-evaluation and self -realization."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 163370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160430, "text": "We've been talking to our little support\ngroup again, haven't we?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 165650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164650, "text": "How'd you know?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 168950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165690, "text": "Because it sounds like you just had your\nbrain washed and you can't do a thing"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 169950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168950, "text": "with it."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 174860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171240, "text": "make fun of me but happy alone healthy\nadults really helped me work through my"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 178420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174860, "text": "divorce and i think some of their\nmethods would be good for you too in"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 183460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178420, "text": "haha prep came out with a new book i\nthink would work wonders for you"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 185680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183460, "text": "the negative how to release your anger"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 200270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198730, "text": "think she's got that area covered."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 248660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245740, "text": "Christine, I couldn't help noticing your\nhair."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 250340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248900, "text": "Oh, thank you, Lizette."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 255060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250880, "text": "But, you know, I've learned from my\ngroup that a person who offers too many"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 257760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255060, "text": "compliments may be hiding a desperate\ndesire to be loved."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 260519, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258079, "text": "Oh, I didn't say I liked your hair."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 263940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262360, "text": "I just noticed it."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 266920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264540, "text": "You've got a spitball stuck in it."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 270020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268620, "text": "Rough gallery, huh?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 274360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273360, "text": "Let's cook it."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 276120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275120, "text": "The Earth."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 280400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277280, "text": "Have you ever heard of global warming?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 285580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282380, "text": "Sure. That's what happens when I use my\nhead to test a barbecue."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 289340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288300, "text": "What are your ones?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 293100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290100, "text": "Uh, can I have that British stamp when\nyou're done with it?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 296680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293440, "text": "That'll complete my collection of stamps\nfrom countries that call women birds."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 301420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300120, "text": "Here's your stamp. Go away."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 307540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305320, "text": "Yes, sir. People versus McCracken."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 308920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307920, "text": "Shoplifting."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 312700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310400, "text": "Prosecution. Have you ever heard of\nglobal warming?"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 315360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314360, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 317240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315580, "text": "Proceed. Yeah,"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 321340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318440, "text": "Mr. McCracken was apprehended at a\nconvenience store on 9th Avenue."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 327400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326400, "text": "Hello?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 332820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331000, "text": "Oh. What is it, man?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 336570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333930, "text": "I'm sorry, sir, but it's a call from\nMiss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 338730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337670, "text": "Somebody named Barbara."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 340370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339370, "text": "What's this all about?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 344570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340710, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry, sir, but I'm on call with\nmy group crisis hotline. It could be a"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 345570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344570, "text": "matter of life and death."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 351950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347170, "text": "All right, we will take a short pause\nwhile Miss Sullivan administers phone"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 353110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351950, "text": "-phone resuscitation."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 357290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354650, "text": "Great, I could use the free time to\nshoulder more of the world's problems."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 360670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358310, "text": "Okay, Barbara, calm down. Okay, what's\nthe matter?"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 362990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361650, "text": "You're at the supermarket, okay?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 365200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364200, "text": "Oh, my."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 367860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365540, "text": "The sweet potatoes remind you of your ex\n-husband."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 371160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369420, "text": "Well, just keep moving."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 372599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371740, "text": "That's it."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 373600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372600, "text": "Go ahead."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 374800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373800, "text": "Go on."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 377800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375780, "text": "Well, don't look at the end of it if\nit's too painful."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 381020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 378560, "text": "Don't you just love a good vegetable\nintervention?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 384580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382840, "text": "Roz, please. I'm reaching out."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 390120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387260, "text": "You made it to the frozen foods. Oh,\ngood for you."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 391720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390720, "text": "How do you feel?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 393200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392200, "text": "Say it."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 395280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394280, "text": "I'm happy, too."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 397840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396840, "text": "Bye."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 401740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398940, "text": "I think I really kept her from going\nover the edge."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 405360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403340, "text": "I think we'll all sleep a little better."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 409120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406240, "text": "Just hope the tater tots don't remind\nher of her children."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 415160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411800, "text": "Roz, Roz, Roz. I hear those doors\nslamming."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 418600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415420, "text": "That's just my blood pressure slamming\nagainst the top of my head."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 423900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420060, "text": "Okay, let's take a little break.\nEveryone go to a neutral corner and come"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 426300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425300, "text": "Too bad."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 427880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426420, "text": "I love a good chick fight."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 435020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430960, "text": "Hey, son, I gotta go mail these bills.\nYou think you could fly solo for a few"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 436020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435020, "text": "minutes?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 437400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436400, "text": "Sure, no sweat."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 440300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438760, "text": "Hey, Jack. Hey, yourself."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 442139, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441280, "text": "Hey, Marty."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 443140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442140, "text": "Hey, myself."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 448080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 445860, "text": "I'm never gonna get down this snappy\npatter."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 450800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449800, "text": "Thanks,"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 452480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451480, "text": "Judge."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 454090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452810, "text": "Just nerves, you know."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 456510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454730, "text": "Flying solo, you know."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 460830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459770, "text": "Everything okay, Marty?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 463350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461850, "text": "Yeah, I mean, it couldn't be better."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 464910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463910, "text": "Not really."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 468390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466950, "text": "Can I talk to you for a minute?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 469810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468810, "text": "It's personal."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 472290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470070, "text": "Well, you're the guy that sells me my\nodor eaters."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 475530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473670, "text": "Nothing can be more personal than that."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 478770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475830, "text": "Shoot. I don't think this line of work\nis for me."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 484040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479530, "text": "Speaking frankly, Marty, Apart from\nmaking change, this line of work ain't"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 485040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484040, "text": "tough."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 486240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485240, "text": "I'm not complaining."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 491080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486320, "text": "I mean, it's just that I have this\nincredible job offer. I mean, it's more"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 492840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491080, "text": "just a job. It's a dream come true."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 494180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493180, "text": "Really? What is it?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 497140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494400, "text": "I'd rather not say until it's a sure\nthing. You know, I don't want to jinx"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 498320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497280, "text": "Yeah, I understand that."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 501360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498580, "text": "But I don't want to break Pop's heart."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 507540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502820, "text": "Every Sunday when I was a boy, he'd sit\nme on his knee and he'd read to me from"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 508540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507540, "text": "O. Henry."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 511070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509870, "text": "Gift of the Magi."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 513549, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511970, "text": "No, the candy bar."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 515830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514610, "text": "Read me the ingredients."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 524049, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518010, "text": "Wow. He must really love this business.\nExactly. I mean, how can I tell him that"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 525450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524049, "text": "I want to do something else?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 529270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526610, "text": "Marty, you know, maybe you're\nunderestimating your dad."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 531030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529730, "text": "He trusts you."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 533230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531590, "text": "Maybe you should trust him."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 535190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534190, "text": "Maybe I should."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 538950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535710, "text": "Hey, Judge Harry, you still here? Yeah,\nyeah, Marty and I were just chatting,"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 540010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 539010, "text": "Jack."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 543010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540190, "text": "You know, I think Marty has something to\ntell you."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 544730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543270, "text": "He can tell me anything he wants."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 547310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545130, "text": "I'm so happy he's here, I'm walking on\nair."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 549910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547930, "text": "Now I can go to the can in the middle of\na shift."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 555270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552170, "text": "Suddenly the world is a very wonderful\nplace."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 559390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557610, "text": "What is it you want to tell me?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 562810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561410, "text": "Pop, I..."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 565210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563790, "text": "I hated being in the Cub Scout."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 569290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567550, "text": "A hundred dollars in time served."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 573870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570410, "text": "And once again, the streets of Manhattan\nare safe from crime, at least until"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 574870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573870, "text": "tomorrow."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 579570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575670, "text": "Uh, Dan, Monique just called from Paris.\nSays she'll pick you up tomorrow night"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 580269, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579570, "text": "after session."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 584110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580270, "text": "Yeah, well... Dan, that's Monique from\nParis."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 585910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584910, "text": "Ooh la la."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 591990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587690, "text": "Mac, do you have any idea how many\ninnocent minks it takes to make a coat?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 594400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593039, "text": "About 210, did it?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 599980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597160, "text": "And he's been able to sleep at night\nknowing that?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 602900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601900, "text": "Uh, Christine?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 604219, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603240, "text": "Yes, Ross?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 608060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604220, "text": "I wanted to apologize about that\nbrainwashing crack I made earlier."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 610220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608340, "text": "Oh, that's okay. I know you didn't mean\nit."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 612720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610620, "text": "Oh, I meant it. I just shouldn't have\nsaid it."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 615980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614980, "text": "Apology accepted."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 621940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616740, "text": "Ross, I see in front of me a person I\ncare about and I want to support."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 625610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622890, "text": "I'm more of a take -care -of -myself\nkind of woman."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 629430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626950, "text": "I know, Roz, but sometimes I feel like\nyou're an island."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 632270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 629670, "text": "You never open up to anyone, and it\nmanifests itself in aggression."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 635510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633050, "text": "I think you could use a support group."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 639490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635750, "text": "No way. You're not gonna get me yapping\nto a bunch of wannabe shrinks."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 643330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640890, "text": "When I'm feeling low, I have my crossbow\nclass."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 649090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645770, "text": "Okay, Roz, but will you do one thing for\nme?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 651050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650050, "text": "A mirror?"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 653080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651420, "text": "What do you want me to do, pluck my\neyebrows?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 655240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654240, "text": "No, Roz."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 656880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655260, "text": "Everyone in my group carries one of\nthese."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 660440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657480, "text": "I will stop bugging you about coming to\na meeting if you could look in that"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 662840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660440, "text": "mirror and say, I am my own best friend."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 665000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663400, "text": "Sure. No big deal."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 673820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667100, "text": "I am... I am... What time does a meeting\nstart?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 687800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685520, "text": "but the people in this room surrounded\nme with a giant hug."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 689700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688380, "text": "You said no touching."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 694460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691040, "text": "Don't worry, Roz. You're a spectator\nthis evening. You don't have to share if"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 695460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694460, "text": "you don't want to."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 697780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695920, "text": "You're totally anonymous at this\nmeeting."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 700400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699400, "text": "Hi, Roz!"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 702320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701120, "text": "What's your problem?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 708640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707140, "text": "Sedan, where are you going to take\nMonique tonight?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 714730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709680, "text": "Well, I was considering the restaurant.\non the top of the World Trade Center,"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 718710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714830, "text": "but the view of all that pollution would\nbe too much for me to handle."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 724530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720250, "text": "How about a romantic stroll through\nCentral Park with a hot dog al fresco?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 727890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726510, "text": "Are you kidding?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 731890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728530, "text": "Fool, do you know what they put in hot\ndogs?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 737870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733350, "text": "Snouts and hoofs and internal organs."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 746000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744040, "text": "Gee, I better finish this quick before\nthat sinks in."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 754480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 752420, "text": "Can I let you in on a secret?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 756100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755100, "text": "Sure, Jack."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 757240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756240, "text": "I'm expanding."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 759860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757580, "text": "I'm buying a newsstand in the IRS\nbuilding."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 763720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760420, "text": "That sounds like a great idea. You'll\nprobably make your money back on Rolaids"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 764720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763720, "text": "alone."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 767500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766200, "text": "Marty, you'll love running it."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 769560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767920, "text": "You're buying the newsstand for Marty?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 773080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769780, "text": "Yeah, well, it'll eat up my retirement\nsavings. But it's worth every penny."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 775260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773660, "text": "The kid's a natural salesman."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 784020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779500, "text": "What the hell was that?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 788180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784380, "text": "That was, uh, just Marty moving the\nmerchandise."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 792160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791160, "text": "Unload."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 793560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792560, "text": "Unload."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 811400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804400, "text": "didn't you spring yes yes christine\nthat's it exactly abandoned an orphan j"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 817020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811400, "text": "anthony what do you think spring should\ndo with those feelings i think she"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 821300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817020, "text": "should face them marcus the words\norphaned and abandoned clearly reveal"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 823620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821300, "text": "she's feeling orphaned and abandoned"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 835860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834860, "text": "Thank you, Jay Anthony."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 837660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836060, "text": "Thank you, Jay Anthony."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 839800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838800, "text": "I'm happy."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 844420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842800, "text": "Roz, isn't this uplifting?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 847320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844800, "text": "I don't think so. My butt's falling\nasleep."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 854120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 849640, "text": "Roz, you look anxious."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 856560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855100, "text": "Is there something you'd like to share?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 858800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857500, "text": "Just a cab ride home."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 863780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861120, "text": "Roz, it's your turn to cry."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 867270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864590, "text": "You keep badgering me and your turn's\ngonna come before mine."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 873570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869890, "text": "Roz, if you have something to add,\nperhaps you'd like to address the whole"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 874570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873570, "text": "group."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 879430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875030, "text": "Well, if Spring is feeling so lonely in\nthat big old house, why don't you just"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 880430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879430, "text": "get a roommate?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 881530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880530, "text": "Or a puppy?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 884670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882690, "text": "Might not be the cure, but it couldn't\nhurt."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 887510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885730, "text": "Well, I think Roz has something there."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 889330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888110, "text": "Please, Christine."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 891730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890730, "text": "Roz is new."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 893910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892190, "text": "She's not ready to interface yet."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 895980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894760, "text": "In your face."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 898720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897720, "text": "Hey."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 901100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899280, "text": "Why don't we do our happy exercise?"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 902500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901500, "text": "Good idea."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 903399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 902760, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 904640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903400, "text": "Everybody up."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 910000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905580, "text": "Okay. Now let's empty our minds."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 913700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911800, "text": "Shouldn't be too tough for this group."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 919360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915760, "text": "Okay. Now let's shake our bodies free\nfrom stress."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 927760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925960, "text": "I haven't felt this free since\nWoodstock."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 935260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929160, "text": "Now, let's all begin focusing on that\nwall that"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 940000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935260, "text": "you've built in your life."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 944300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942540, "text": "Christine, why don't we start with you?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 945540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944540, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 953440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946600, "text": "My wall is a symbol of all the"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 954640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953440, "text": "conflict in my life."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 957260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955240, "text": "Get to the wall, Christine. Get to the\nwall."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 959640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958620, "text": "Oh, brother."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 966180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961520, "text": "Okay, um, um, it's a stucco wall."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 970220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966760, "text": "And I've painted it salmon."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 992620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988840, "text": "sweating now. Do you feel the cleansing\nprocess?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 995320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993460, "text": "Do you feel the rush of relief?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 999140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995900, "text": "Do you feel the urge to scream and run\ninto traffic?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1004840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002280, "text": "Major negativity from our guest."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1007900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006040, "text": "I'm getting a migraine from her vibes."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1010300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008300, "text": "I'd like to hear about Roz's wall."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1012300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010720, "text": "I don't have a damn wall."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1016120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013180, "text": "But I do have a bulldozer and a man to\nuse it."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1020760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018440, "text": "What a humorous observation. Thank you,\nRoz."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1022020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021020, "text": "Come on, Roz."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1024720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022560, "text": "Describe your bulldozer."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1026180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025180, "text": "Describe."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1028200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026480, "text": "Describe. Describe."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1032859, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029319, "text": "It's big and it's bad, and I'm driving\nit the hell out of here."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1038480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037480, "text": "Roz, wait."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1039700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038700, "text": "Please."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1046359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041339, "text": "I'm sorry, Christine, but this mumbo\njumbo isn't for me. It's not mumbo"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1048580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1046980, "text": "Okay, it is mumbo jumbo."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1051920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049560, "text": "But it's good mumbo jumbo."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1056620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052900, "text": "Ross, when Tony left me, I hit rock\nbottom. When I needed someone, these"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1057620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056620, "text": "were there."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1061080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057800, "text": "As stupid as it may seem to you, it\nreally worked for me."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1066000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062120, "text": "Okay, I must admit that sometimes I do\nget a little dependent on it and I use"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1067000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066000, "text": "for a crutch."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1071400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067400, "text": "Christine, why don't you stop looking at\nthe wall and try to hurdle it?"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1073980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072420, "text": "I'll know when it's time to break away."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1077330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076330, "text": "I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1079470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077390, "text": "I didn't mean to underestimate you."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1081610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080610, "text": "See you at work."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1091250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090250, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1092630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091630, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1095230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093990, "text": "We've made a decision."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1097770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096410, "text": "Stay away from Roz."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1100070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098070, "text": "Her negativity is destroying you."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1103490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101570, "text": "But she's my best friend."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1105610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104150, "text": "You're your own best friend."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1112820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111820, "text": "For what?"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1114740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113120, "text": "For you to blow it out your shorts."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1118680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117680, "text": "Goodbye, everyone."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1123560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120580, "text": "Oh, and by the way, I'm still happy."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1132460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128220, "text": "I asked you two guys in here because you\nneed to talk to each other about"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1134840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132460, "text": "Marty's plans, his desires."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1136940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135940, "text": "Desires?"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1138260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137120, "text": "You're not gay, are you?"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1140920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139920, "text": "Yeah, that's it."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1143190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142090, "text": "Let's go back to the stand."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1146570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143430, "text": "Marty, what did you tell me about your\nfather's business?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1149110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147550, "text": "I love Pop's business."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1151490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149390, "text": "I wouldn't trade it for anything in the\nworld."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1153790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152090, "text": "What about your dreams, Marty?"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1155090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154090, "text": "Dreams?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1162050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156390, "text": "Marty, your father's about to spend his\nlife savings to buy you a newsstand."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1164070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162910, "text": "Now tell him."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1168070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164970, "text": "Oh, Pop, don't waste your money."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1172230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170410, "text": "Uncle Leo called from Florida."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1174130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172590, "text": "Cousin Nick's quitting the business."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1175830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1174530, "text": "There's finally an opening."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1177270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176270, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1180810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177650, "text": "But it's a dream job, Jack. A dream job.\nNo."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1185810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181070, "text": "But, Pop, five generations have walked\nthis road before me. That's no way to"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1188810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185810, "text": "make a living. No, absolutely not. It's\ntoo shaky."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1191930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189210, "text": "Five generations, Jack. How shaky can it\nbe?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1193590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192290, "text": "How shaky can it be?"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1195990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193970, "text": "Kid wants to be a human cannonball."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1202100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198480, "text": "You should support him in his dream. A\nhuman cannonball!"}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1207800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204340, "text": "You know how badly I've always wanted to\nbe in the family business? No, no,"}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1209720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207820, "text": "that's your mother's family, not mine."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1211760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209960, "text": "Those damn flying fanuchis."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1216380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213800, "text": "You want to be shot out of a cannon?\nWhat the hell are you, nuts?"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1222160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218400, "text": "I know how important the stand is to\nyou, and if you want me to stay, I will."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1227720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222540, "text": "But I need the bright lights. The smell\nof the gunpowder."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1230840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229100, "text": "The concussion under my feet."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1233540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231800, "text": "Oh, man, this is weird."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1236140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234580, "text": "Jack, I had no idea."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1238200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1237200, "text": "It's in my blood."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1241500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238880, "text": "Yeah, which is going to be splattered\nall over the ground."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1243380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242380, "text": "Wait."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1245260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244200, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1248480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246520, "text": "I remember the day I met your mother."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1251300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249200, "text": "She was traveling with the Ringling\nbrothers."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1256280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252220, "text": "She shot out of that cannon, sailed\nacross the arena."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1259280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257360, "text": "Missed the net and landed in my lap."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1261860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260780, "text": "It was magic."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1267500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263660, "text": "But I never wanted you mixing with those\ncircus people."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1272280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269120, "text": "But it's all I ever wanted."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1276840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273600, "text": "Please, Pop, give me your blessing."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1281060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277140, "text": "Marty, Marty, Marty, listen to your\nfather. You want to have your face"}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1283060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281060, "text": "into the dirt from 300 feet?"}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1284380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283380, "text": "Harry, Harry."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1287470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1285450, "text": "He's heard the calling. What can I do?"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1290090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289090, "text": "Come on, son."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1291970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290670, "text": "I'll buy you a helmet."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1296730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294290, "text": "Oh, I gotta stay out of these family\nthings."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1299950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298510, "text": "That's it for tonight, folks."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1307350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301350, "text": "But tune in tomorrow for our next\nsteaming episode of As the Gavel Pound."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1310570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309310, "text": "Somebody to see you, Dave."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1312150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310970, "text": "Oh, please, no more."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1316990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313050, "text": "I've got the rainforests here, the\nendangered species here, the homeless"}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1319190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316990, "text": "hungry here. I don't have room for\nanything else."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1320910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319850, "text": "Not even for me?"}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1323950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1321510, "text": "Oh, Monique. Hello, Daniel. I'm here."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1327770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324330, "text": "Shall we start with dinner at Elaine's?"}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1329190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328190, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1333210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329810, "text": "Monique, do you realize that the cost of\nthat expensive meal could feed an"}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1334970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333210, "text": "entire village in Bangladesh?"}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1339840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1335980, "text": "And the cab right there would only add\nto the pollution level that's choking"}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1344580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339840, "text": "atmosphere, depleting our ozone layer.\nNot to mention the garbage that the meal"}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1345580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344580, "text": "itself would create."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1350940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345960, "text": "Bags and bags of non -biodegradable\nplastic that'll exist in our landfills"}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1352100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350940, "text": "50 ,000 years."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1354860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352800, "text": "Not that the planet will be around that\nlong."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1360820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356420, "text": "Wait, no, Monique, Monique, Monique. I'm\nsorry, please."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1368690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367690, "text": "It's not me."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1373190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1372190, "text": "Hey, Rod."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1376010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374130, "text": "Busy? You want to hang out?"}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1379150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377130, "text": "Don't you have other people to hang out\nwith?"}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1383750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379930, "text": "No, I just hurtled my wall and I'm\nheading in a new direction."}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1386510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384450, "text": "Oh. Which way are you heading?"}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1390270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1387410, "text": "I thought maybe that New Age pool hall\ndown on 14th Street."}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1392490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1391270, "text": "All right, you break."}
